                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75f7ec1b-1d36-3d27-ae71-5a78e02cefd3",
                        "entry_id": "9d9270e6-d56d-38a5-a7a7-187920044ea3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. близкий, сходный по духу, образу мыслей, таланту и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c0f22f8-7ed0-4769-b9d8-a8f7fc5a47b0",
                                "sense_id": "75f7ec1b-1d36-3d27-ae71-5a78e02cefd3",
                                "text": "Так как мы ничего не знаем, то мы не можем быть гениальными. Всякий раз может оказаться, что велосипед уже изобретен. Таким образом — наш удел быть только конгениальными."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29c4abdf-ee7b-461f-8e7a-e1db927e369a",
                        "source_entry_id": "9d9270e6-d56d-38a5-a7a7-187920044ea3",
                        "source_sense_id": "75f7ec1b-1d36-3d27-ae71-5a78e02cefd3",
                        "target_lang_word": "congenial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "congenial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b58a9df9-8521-39f2-9a52-7c4bb4169983",
                                        "entry_id": "28b371ab-1b08-39d3-80c7-4a59e2d07e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the same or very similar nature, personality, tastes, habits or interests."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10fd4092-6730-46b2-a4b0-0bb23a0b1814",
                                                "sense_id": "b58a9df9-8521-39f2-9a52-7c4bb4169983",
                                                "text": "No sluggish tide congenial to the glooms; / This, as it frothed by, might have been a bath / For the fiend's glowing hoof - to see the wrath / Of its black eddy bespate with flakes and spumes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3925a529-df9f-390a-8423-8836a64e2b59",
                                        "entry_id": "28b371ab-1b08-39d3-80c7-4a59e2d07e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Friendly or sociable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b5abb96-2a85-47be-9a34-62bc9ca243b9",
                                                "sense_id": "3925a529-df9f-390a-8423-8836a64e2b59",
                                                "text": "The congenial bartender makes the Hog’s Head an inviting place to hang out during the weekends."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24d12d28-83d4-3e77-8ad1-5fb571b08178",
                                        "entry_id": "28b371ab-1b08-39d3-80c7-4a59e2d07e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suitable to one’s needs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b3ebd9-6c53-4c9b-bf85-7468c8d89796",
                                                "sense_id": "24d12d28-83d4-3e77-8ad1-5fb571b08178",
                                                "text": "What was it that made this notion of mimesis, in spite of its inherent difficulties that only the dialectical method enables him to avoid, seem so useful and congenial to Plato?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc09c2d9-50d5-4946-8ab1-ed8b0e59cc5f",
                        "source_entry_id": "9d9270e6-d56d-38a5-a7a7-187920044ea3",
                        "source_sense_id": "75f7ec1b-1d36-3d27-ae71-5a78e02cefd3",
                        "target_lang_word": "congenial",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1fe97112-c3bf-4771-9328-c70872a26b50",
                        "source_entry_id": "9d9270e6-d56d-38a5-a7a7-187920044ea3",
                        "source_sense_id": "75f7ec1b-1d36-3d27-ae71-5a78e02cefd3",
                        "target_lang_word": "congénial",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "congénial",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e774fc46-b87c-3398-88ea-c1523a21af46",
                                        "entry_id": "f2e05628-a897-37f6-84f8-5e22c1275a84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En accord avec le génie propre (de la personne ou la chose désignée par le complément d'attribution)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d59a665-61e9-43fa-89af-2d6a033571f0",
                                                "sense_id": "e774fc46-b87c-3398-88ea-c1523a21af46",
                                                "text": "Des amusements congéniaux à son âge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7bcc2aa-7cef-4eb8-9be3-e2a7b96bcd8c",
                                                "sense_id": "e774fc46-b87c-3398-88ea-c1523a21af46",
                                                "text": "Son talent, quoique parfaitement original, est un singulier mélange de Vélasquez, de Rembrandt et de Reynolds ; il rappelle tour à tour ou en même temps ces trois maîtres, mais comme le fils rappelle ses aïeux, sans imitation servile, ou plutôt par une disposition congéniale que par une volonté formelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e5cb8e4-670b-4ced-9b62-81888986fd23",
                                                "sense_id": "e774fc46-b87c-3398-88ea-c1523a21af46",
                                                "text": "Tout ce que vous me dites à propos de croyances, et de la source intime de la foi, m'est parfaitement congénial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27f94c17-53c6-3513-a201-c55b8a6a4432",
                                        "entry_id": "f2e05628-a897-37f6-84f8-5e22c1275a84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est présent dès la naissance, en parlant de certaines infirmités."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0131abef-788b-461c-9057-56e9c48d6bd7",
                                                "sense_id": "27f94c17-53c6-3513-a201-c55b8a6a4432",
                                                "text": "J’aurais un enfant affecté d’un vice congénial, scrofuleux, par exemple, je le tuerais."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
